# Copy to .env.local for local development. Leave both unset to run against
# browser storage instead — the app falls back automatically.
#
# Find these in the Supabase dashboard under Project Settings → API.
# The anon key is meant to be public and is compiled into the client bundle;
# row level security (supabase/schema.sql) is what protects the data. Never put
# the service_role key here — it bypasses RLS entirely.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
